{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07544","headline":"咏史十一首 六 · 李华","name":"咏史十一首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日照崑仑上，羽人披羽衣。\n乘龙驾云雾，欲往心无违。\n此山在西北，乃是神仙国。\n灵气皆自然，求之不可得。\n何爲汉武帝，精思徧羣山。\n糜费巨万计，宫车终不还。\n苍苍茂陵树，足以戒人间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李华","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07544.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07544","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}